                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-black">⚡</div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">3-6 Hour Approval</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Same-day UK company registration submitted before 3 PM gets Companies House approval within 3-6 working hours. No multi-day delays.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Certainty -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-blue-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-brand-blue rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-black">✓</div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">99.7% First-Pass</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Our ACSP validation system catches rejectable issues before submission. Only 3 in 1,000 fast formations require resubmission.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Trading Ready -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-purple-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-black">🎯</div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">Trade Immediately</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">With same-day incorporation, you can open business bank accounts, sign contracts, and start trading within hours of approval.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Timeline Comparison -->
