                            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 font-black">⏳</div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900">DIY/Standard Filing</h3>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="space-y-4">
                            <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                                <span class="text-gray-400 font-black text-lg">—</span>
