                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                                <span class="text-gray-400 font-black text-lg">—</span>
                                <span class="text-gray-700"><strong>Day 4-5:</strong> Wait for approval (or rejection)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                                <span class="text-gray-400 font-black text-lg">—</span>
                                <span class="text-gray-700"><strong>Day 7-10+:</strong> Get banking account</span>
