                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-white">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tighter mb-16 text-center">Fast UK LTD Registration Questions</h2>

                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-[1.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">What makes same-day UK company registration possible?</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">We are ACSP-verified (Authorized Corporate Service Providers) and file directly with Companies House through the government gateway. Our pre-validation system ensures zero rejection-causing issues, so Companies House approves fast formations within hours instead of days.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-[1.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">What is the latest time I can submit for same-day approval?</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Applications submitted before 3 PM UK time on any working day are processed same-day, with Companies House approval typically coming within 3-6 working hours. Applications after 3 PM are queued for next-day processing.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-[1.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">Is same-day faster UK company registration more expensive?</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">No. Our same-day package is £189.99 (Standard Plus), only £70 more than our basic Starter package. You're paying for speed and certainty, not premium filing fees. All packages include the mandatory £100 Companies House filing fee.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-[1.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">Can I open a bank account after same-day UK company registration?</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Yes. Your Companies House Certificate of Incorporation is typically issued within hours. Banks like Wise, Revolut, and Payoneer can process business account applications within 24-48 hours of receiving your incorporation certificate. Our Premium package includes banking assistance.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-[1.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">What if my same-day company registration gets rejected?</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Rejections are extremely rare (0.3% of same-day filings). Our ACSP validation catches issues before submission. If rejection occurs, we resubmit immediately at no additional cost and typically get approval within the same business day.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

