                        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">💰</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-green-600 transition">Budget Option</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4">Start from just £119.99 with zero hidden fees</p>
